  <item>
    <title>EP14 如何高段位收礼物</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69ac7e8c5b2d0ed069d832fc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69ac7e8c5b2d0ed069d832fc</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Mar 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>礼物是一件很奇怪的东西。有人用它表达爱，有人用它完成任务，有人用它弥补愧疚，也有人用它制造浪漫。但我们真正想要的，可能从来不是礼物本身。而是那种感觉：原来有人真的观察过我。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期我们聊聊彼此收到过什么印象深刻的礼物：有人收到花，有人收到石头。有人精心准备相册，有人送第四个擀面杖。礼物到底是表达爱，还是一场关于金钱、用心和关系温度的考试？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>三三</span></p><span></span><p><span>八八</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Show Note】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> 好瞎的大无语礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 聊一聊礼物这门学问</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2721">45:21</a> 圣诞礼物烤了一天一夜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3170">52:50</a> 印象深刻的好礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期🎵】</span></p><span></span><p><span>One More Shot – CIL</span></p><span></span><p><span>【商务合作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：296226751@qq.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/684940a9beddee889d7184bc/lvH65zaw1SDhHu434VqVXhjc35bt.m4a" length="70366379" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkKDUwY1vnzU5_IHRe6CEtf2ZIPJ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
