  <item>
    <title>EP10 妈妈，我不相亲行不行</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68e138ba8bf86095c5cc3d2f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68e138ba8bf86095c5cc3d2f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Oct 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期路边狂花，八八和三三从一场相亲盲盒开启，聊非诚勿扰马诺的“宝马论”，董璇张维伊的姐弟恋，再到婚恋市场里的不平等逻辑：女性的外貌与男性的社会资本如何被异化为筹码。我们也分享了各自亲历或身边的相亲故事——婚介所8k会费的无效约会、八千公里跨国被迫相亲，以及Tinder/Bumble/Blindmate等现代交友app的奇葩机制。从《混沌少年时》里的Incel 男群体到《牯岭街少年杀人事件》里的工具人女主角，看见仇女与自我厌弃背后的社会逻辑。最后揭晓盲盒相亲的“真相”，友情提醒：无论你要面包还是爱情，或者只是想认识更多人类多样性标本——都没关系。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>三三</span></p><span></span><p><span>八八</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Show Note】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a> 相亲这件小事</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>马诺对不起，董璇选了张维伊</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="909">15:09</a> 拜金女 vs Incel男</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>比起做拜金女更爽的是成为贾玲</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期🎵】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lover Girl-Laufey</span></p><span></span><p><span>【商务合作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：296226751@qq.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/684940a9beddee889d7184bc/li8arziWc2XMQrnjH-lkcc-_beXl.m4a" length="32635891" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkKDUwY1vnzU5_IHRe6CEtf2ZIPJ.jpg"/>
