    <title>EP01 从凤姐到德国：初代网红的&quot;生存法则&quot;与留德华的&quot;人间真实&quot;</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68494c51574f0657219a7ae4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68494c51574f0657219a7ae4</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Jun 2025 09:43:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>第一期节目，我们把目光投向15年前的初代网红——凤姐罗玉凤。从她那些引发全网热议的征婚广告，到最终出走美国的戏剧性转折，我们看到了一个备受争议却又耐人寻味的生存故事。在德国生活的这些年，当我们亲身经历语言障碍、文化差异和身份焦虑时，突然意识到：凤姐当年的'疯癫'表现，或许只是另一个方式的'逃离'。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>三三</span></p><span></span><p><span>八八</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Show Note】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> 我们是谁，路边狂花在狂什么</span></p><span></span><p><span>30岁裸辞留德手册</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a> 凤姐大家还记得吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>活到2025年还在回忆非主流QQ和人人网的校园秘史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="486">08:06</a> 德国留子的捡破烂生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>够胆出国，没胆花钱</span></p><span></span><p><span>网红图鉴—芙蓉姐姐，犀利哥，奶茶妹妹章泽天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="874">14:34</a> 恋爱里的右划</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tinder人类观察—从刷墙工到化学博士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1405">23:25</a> 女丑角吃上男天鹅肉</span></p><span></span><p><span>可恶，还是被杨笠说中了，这样的蒋雯丽也会吃不上帅哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1789">29:49</a> 女性的欲望：病态还是主体</span></p><span></span><p><span>欧洲有自己的剧本杀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2308">38:28</a> 坏女人的破坏力？生命力？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我要洋人死！德国室友退退退！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2976">49:36</a> 娜拉出走后是堕落还是回来</span></p><span></span><p><span>在国外当牛马打工需要几步？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3119">51:59</a> 我们在德国的堕落（划掉）打工生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>早知道2小时6000欧，就不会有“康永哥，他们让我刷马桶诶？！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3524">58:44</a> 是继续逃离还是回去</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们在德国跟杨天真一样也找到了自我？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期🎵】</span></p><span></span><p><span>I don’t really care for you-CMAT</span></p><span></span><p><span>【商务合作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：296226751@qq.com&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
